      <p class="adt-body text-left italic leading-relaxed text-slate-800">
        <span data-id="pg071_n0033">Qyteti &#xeb;sht&#xeb; vendbanim i madh dhe urban, n&#xeb; t&#xeb; cilin shumica e popullsis&#xeb; jeton nga industria, tregtia dhe aktivitetet e sh&#xeb;rbimit.</span>
        <span data-id="pg071_n0034">N&#xeb; qytete ka shum&#xeb; nd&#xeb;rmarrje industriale, tregtare, institucione politike, shoq&#xeb;rore, sh&#xeb;ndet&#xeb;sore, kulturore dhe administrative.</span>
        <span data-id="pg071_n0035">Qytetet dikur kishin nd&#xeb;rtesa t&#xeb; ul&#xeb;ta, rrug&#xeb; t&#xeb; ngushta, pak mjete komunikacioni, zona t&#xeb; gjelbra.</span>
        <span data-id="pg071_n0036">Numri i spitaleve, i shkollave dhe i &#xe7;erdheve nuk ishte i madh dhe t&#xeb; gjitha ishin institucione shtet&#xeb;rore.</span>
        <span data-id="pg071_n0037">Qytetet sot kan&#xeb; rrug&#xeb; t&#xeb; gjera, komunikacion t&#xeb; dendur, parkingje t&#xeb; shumta, nd&#xeb;rtesa t&#xeb; larta, kurse zonat e gjelbra jan&#xeb; zvog&#xeb;luar shum&#xeb;.</span>
        <span data-id="pg071_n0038">N&#xeb; qytete ka shum&#xeb; shkolla shtet&#xeb;rore e private.</span>
        <span data-id="pg071_n0039">Ka shum&#xeb; kopshte e &#xe7;erdhe, t&#xeb; cilat ofrojn&#xeb; sh&#xeb;rbime edukative dhe t&#xeb; kujdesit p&#xeb;r f&#xeb;mij&#xeb;t n&#xeb; kuad&#xeb;r t&#xeb; edukimit parashkollor.</span>
        <span data-id="pg071_n0040">Ka spitale shtet&#xeb;rore e private, n&#xeb; t&#xeb; cilat njer&#xeb;zit gjejn&#xeb; sh&#xeb;rbimin e duhur p&#xeb;r t&#x2019;u sh&#xeb;ruar nga s&#xeb;mundjet e ndryshme.</span>
      </p>
